Start with the same ordinary field note in four cards. The words stay fixed;
only the card theme changes, so the paper, Post-it, and plain treatments can be
compared directly.

- [Theme comparison](./comparison.memo.card)
- [Paper / cream](./comparison-paper.memo.card)
- [Paper / manila](./comparison-manila.memo.card)
- [Post-it / yellow](./comparison-post-it.memo.card)
- [Plain / neutral](./comparison-plain.memo.card)
- [Quotes and attribution](./quotes.memo.card)
- [Structured sample](./structured.record.card)
- [Long content](./long-form.memo.card)
- [Stack experiment](./stack-experiment.memo.card)
- [Mixed stocks](./mixed-stocks.memo.card)

The comparison cards are deliberately ordinary fictional material. Their
theme choices belong to the card-theme engine, so this seed stays useful while
that engine evolves.
